[Sheet: Header]
Canopy Cable Schedule: Corwyn Office Complex PV (PXA-2023-0629)
Brantley Electric Company · Alleron Electrical Contractor Lic. #EC-12306
Drawing E-201 Rev C, 06/24/2025. Inverter output circuits from each canopy's inverter to SWBD-PV. Each canopy's inverter output circuit runs in rigid metal conduit along its main beam; the ladder tray on the north side of the beam holds the PV circuits (E-301).
Prepared: K. Osei, Electrical Engineer, Brantley Electric Company, 06/24/2025.
