[Sheet: Trays]
Item	Construction
Trays	One 12 in. hot-dip galvanized steel ladder tray per canopy, 9 in. rung spacing, on the north side of the canopy main beam; tray sections bonded with bonding jumpers
Supports	Tray clamps to the beam at 1.5 m centers
Column risers	Rigid steel conduit, threaded, with a bonding bushing at the tray end